---
import layout from '../data/galaxy-v02.json';
import { destinations, activities } from '../data/navigation';
const byHref = new Map([...destinations, ...activities].map(item => [item.href, item]));
const config = { ...layout, nodes: layout.nodes.map(node => { const item = byHref.get(node.href); return item ? { ...node, name: item.name, nameEn: item.en } : node; }) };
import '../styles/galaxy-v02.css';
const { start = 'map' } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="pug" data-galaxy-v02 data-design="A" data-prototype="0" data-start={start}>
 <div class="titlebar"><div><p class="kicker">MPC / GALACTIC ATLAS · 02 / G01</p><h1>星系图谱</h1><p>中央枢纽 · 四个星域 · 15 个真实导航入口</p></div><div class="mode"><button type="button" data-mode="map" aria-pressed="true">星图</button><button type="button" data-mode="directory" aria-pressed="false">目录</button></div></div>
 <div class="toolbar"><input data-search type="search" aria-label="搜索目的地" placeholder="搜索中文、英文、关键词…"><select data-sector aria-label="星域筛选"><option value="">全部星域</option></select><select data-visit aria-label="访问状态"><option value="">全部状态</option><option value="visited">已记录</option><option value="new">未记录</option></select><button type="button" data-clear>清除筛选</button></div>
 <p class="result-text" data-result role="status"></p>
 <div class="layout"><div class="map-frame" data-map><div class="map-head"><span>SECTOR / 134340</span><span data-zoom-text>全图 · 100%</span></div><div class="viewport" data-view tabindex="0" aria-label="星图；方向键移动，加减号缩放"><div class="world" data-world><svg class="lines" viewBox="0 0 1200 780" aria-hidden="true"><g data-shapes></g><g data-lines></g></svg></div><div class="map-note">拖动 / 滚轮 / 双指缩放<br>远景仅显示主要星域入口</div><div class="map-tools"><button type="button" data-zoom="-1" aria-label="缩小">−</button><button type="button" data-zoom="1" aria-label="放大">+</button><button type="button" data-center aria-label="定位中央枢纽">⌂</button><button type="button" data-focus aria-label="定位选中目的地">◎</button><button type="button" data-reset>全图</button></div></div><div class="map-foot"><span>ART / LICENSED PIXEL ASSETS</span><span>非真实天体比例</span></div></div><div class="directory" data-directory hidden><div class="dir-grid" data-dir></div><p class="empty" data-empty hidden>没有符合条件的目的地，请清除筛选。</p></div><aside class="panel mobile-collapsed" data-panel aria-label="目的地详情"><div class="panel-top"><span class="kicker">DESTINATION / 目的地</span><button type="button" data-detail-toggle aria-expanded="false">展开详情</button></div><div class="preview"><img data-preview alt=""><span>授权美术预览 · 非页面截图</span></div><p class="kicker" data-en></p><h2 data-name></h2><p class="desc" data-description></p><dl class="facts"><dt>星域</dt><dd data-region></dd><dt>访问状态</dt><dd data-status></dd><dt>实际路径</dt><dd data-path></dd></dl><a class="go" data-go href="/">前往目的地 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p class="muted" data-sim></p><p class="kicker related-title" style="margin-top:18px">CONNECTED / 关联目的地</p><div class="related" data-related></div></aside></div>
 <div class="legend" data-legend></div><div class="recent-route" data-recent hidden aria-label="最近访问目的地"></div><div class="statusbar"><span class="muted" data-log role="status">当前：星系图谱</span><div style="display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap"><button type="button" data-layer aria-pressed="true">航线图层</button><button type="button" data-motion aria-pressed="true">航行动效</button><button type="button" data-erase>清除星图记录</button></div></div><p class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">星域是功能导航，不代表真实天体位置。访问记录仅保存在当前浏览器；选择预览不会记录访问。航行时按 Esc 可立即跳过动效。</p><details class="asset-credits"><summary>美术来源与授权</summary><p><a href="https://opengameart.org/content/sci-fi-top-down-centrifuge-space-station">ChaosShark · Centrifuge Space Station</a> / <a href="https://opengameart.org/content/sci-fi-top-down-shipyard-space-station">Shipyard Space Station</a>（CC0，裁切、缩小、调色，船坞旋转）；<a href="https://opengameart.org/content/pixel-planets-64x64">Darklighter Designs · Pixel Planets (64×64)</a>（<a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/">CC BY 3.0</a>，透明边裁切）；<a href="https://opengameart.org/content/pixel-planets">Master484 · Pixel Planets</a> / <a href="https://opengameart.org/content/1616-ship-collection">16×16 Ship Collection</a>（公有领域，分割）；<a href="https://opengameart.org/content/animated-spaceships">Jull · Animated Spaceships</a>、<a href="https://opengameart.org/content/spaceship-set-32x32px">Scrittl · Spaceship set</a>、<a href="https://screamingbrainstudios.com/dl-seamless-space-backgrounds/">Screaming Brain Studios</a>、Ansimuz、Foozle、scorcher24（CC0；裁切、分帧、缩小与调色）。另有 dog-eared（CC0）暖色行星及项目自制数学纹理天体。完整来源见 docs/galaxy-v02/Asset_Inventory.csv。</p></details>
 <noscript><nav aria-label="目的地目录">{config.nodes.map(node => <a href={node.href} style="display:inline-block;padding:8px">{node.name}</a>)}</nav></noscript>
 <script type="application/json" data-galaxy-config is:inline set:html={JSON.stringify(config).replace(/</g, "\\u003c")}></script>
</section>

<script is:inline defer src="/scripts/galaxy-v02.js"></script>
